      "writtenOn": "2026-10-30T17:40:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Minor optimization: `mte_zero_clear_slice_tags()` calls `mte_set_mem_tag_range(..., PAGE_SIZE_4KB, 0, true)` (`DC GZVA`), which zeroes both data and allocation tags right before `memcpy()` overwrites all 4KB of data. Clearing only the tags (`mte_set_mem_tag_range(..., PAGE_SIZE_4KB, 0, false)`) would avoid zeroing the 4KB slice twice on `UFFDIO_COPY`.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "1f5ac3f00fa7dd8c1ffda11b32d6f076afe5d251",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
